  "description": "Google FlatBuffers integration for NetToolsKit.Serialization.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t• AutoFlatBuffersSchema for zero-configuration (~5-10x faster than JSON).\n\t\t\t• SchemaMessageSerializer for manual schema (~10-100x faster).\n\t\t\t• Zero-allocation design for critical paths.\n\t\t\t• 7 type handlers (primitives, strings, DateTime, Guid, collections).\n\n\t\t\tIdeal for high-performance scenarios, event sourcing, IoT, and microservices.",
